{"mainQuestId":76114,"title":"The Suspicious Hermit","description":"In the northern Lempo Isle, east of the Nothing Passage, lived a hermit called Derwent who regularly visited friends in Nasha Town. Recently, however, not only has he stopped going to Nasha Town, he's also refusing all visiting guests. The recluse appears to have undergone significant changes in both appearance and habits... There is, however, another notable detail: a traveling merchant claims that their associate, who regularly delivered goods to the hermit, has gone missing after their last visit... To uncover the truth, a direct visit may be the best approach.","titleTextMapHash":2726539367,"descTextMapHash":3022631014,"mainQuestExcel":{"mainQuestId":76114,"titleTextMapHash":2726539367,"title":"The Suspicious Hermit","descTextMapHash":3022631014,"description":"In the northern Lempo Isle, east of the Nothing Passage, lived a hermit called Derwent who regularly visited friends in Nasha Town. Recently, however, not only has he stopped going to Nasha Town, he's also refusing all visiting guests. The recluse appears to have undergone significant changes in both appearance and habits... There is, however, another notable detail: a traveling merchant claims that their associate, who regularly delivered goods to the hermit, has gone missing after their last visit... To uncover the truth, a direct visit may be the best approach.","chapterId":0,"mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","activityId":0,"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/WQ76114","mainQuestRaw":{"activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","activityId":0,"chapterId":0,"descTextMapHash":3022631014,"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GMENNHMBBOH":[{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0}],"id":76114,"IELNANBAMLH":"QUEST_P